# Nemotron Hyperdrive (trt-loop, 2026-11-02): NHD_GUIDED_SKIP=1 skips the grammar host functions, bitmask copies and
# GPU drains (4 per step) of one-model speculative decoding in eager steps whose batch has no guided request, where they
# are no-ops; they kept the GPU idle ~19 ms per 32K prefill step and ~16 ms per mixed step (j21, j22 py-spy). Batches
# with a guided request, CUDA-graph steps and the first eager step after graph replays keep the stock path.
