+        The first eager call of a step decides for the whole step. A skipped step consumes its own queue entry
+        here (the newest one; older entries belong to CUDA-graph host nodes that have not run yet and pop from the
+        front) instead of in fetch_batch, so the queue stays aligned with the steps.
+        """
+        if not _NHD_GUIDED_SKIP or torch.cuda.is_current_stream_capturing():
+            return False
